{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1304411-mass-combat-the-engage-action","id":1304411,"title":"Mass Combat, the Engage action","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-04-12T01:37:38-07:00","id":1304411,"title":"Mass Combat, the Engage action","content":"So I was reviewing the Mass Combat rules and... What- what is happening with the Engage action? Its the only thing in the entire book that deducts Initiative from a Battle Group's initial JB roll.<br /> <br /> Does that mean that a Battle Group can only engage targets up to half of its JB roll? Does it mean that a Battle Group can Crash itself, much as anyone who pays for a Gambit can? Why is this weird little thing here?(P.209 Core)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1247-maseiken","name":"Maseiken","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1247_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"170"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-12T03:24:52-07:00","id":1304424,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Maseiken</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1304411-mass-combat-the-engage-action#post1304411\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So I was reviewing the Mass Combat rules and... What- what is happening with the Engage action? Its the only thing in the entire book that deducts Initiative from a Battle Group's initial JB roll.<br /> <br /> Does that mean that a Battle Group can only engage targets up to half of its JB roll? Does it mean that a Battle Group can Crash itself, much as anyone who pays for a Gambit can? Why is this weird little thing here?(P.209 Core)</div> </div> </div> </div>It seems to me that a battle group analogue for grappling is something that would both need to be addressed in their modified combat system and just makes logical sense, and that it ought to be a bit costly since the inability to move away from one can be fairly deadly.<br /> <br /> I'm not sure why there would be confusion over the limits of how much it can be used based on how much one's Initiative is.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-12T13:39:16-07:00","id":1304495,"title":"","content":"Mostly I just think it\u2019s kind of a weird edge case where Battle Groups songs spend or gain initiative except for this One Thing they can do,<br /> <br /> Like yeah it makes sense that an Battle Group can surround an opponent, but they already have a rule that makes it easier for them to disengage from smaller combatants, so I kinda feel like it\u2019d be better represented by movement rules than by one gambit with no way to regain the lost initiative? Idk, it just feels out of place to me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1247-maseiken","name":"Maseiken","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1247_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"170"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}